spice
* SPICE Netlist

VDD 8 0 DC 20V
Vi 4 0 AC 1V

R1 8 5 420k
RD 5 2 2.7k
R2 4 2 180k
RL 2 6 4k
RS 2 3 2.7k

C1 4 2 10uF
C2 2 6 10uF
CS 3 0 10uF

* Node Identification
* Node 0: Ground
* Node 2: Common node between RD, R2, RS, C2
* Node 4: Vi input node
* Node 5: Node between R1, RD
* Node 6: Output node Vo
* Node 8: VDD

.end